        <mxCell id="c124" value="&lt;b&gt;Manual hand-off points.&lt;/b&gt; Information moves form to paper to spreadsheet to print to social media. Each arrow is a re-keying event, so transcription error compounds at every hop. Process 5.0 reads from D2 but never writes back, so the printed directory and the online listing diverge permanently with no detection mechanism. Coordinates and boundary assignments are absent from the As-Is model entirely." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="640" width="500" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
